# Location improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

When this agent touches warehouse map, aisle/floor/shipping pick, or location
intelligence, **own the location improve loop**.

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_location/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json`.
2. Fix real top failures (wrong zone filters, free-text regressions, pick mode).
3. Re-run: `python scripts/location_improve_loop.py`.
4. Append lessons to `qa_location/synthetic/training_lessons.json`.
5. Expand cases for new map categories / blocked zones.

## Constraints

- Aisle / floor / shipping: map-first pick — no free-text entry for those categories.
- Outside may use tiles; do not reintroduce free-text for map categories.

Docs: `qa_location/synthetic/README.md`.
